machine fork/a
  states
    unchosen
    chosen

  transition goLeft()
    unchosen -> chosen
    guard room/aHall `cleared` mark/yes
    assert path/an `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` chosen
    retract self `state`

  transition goRight()
    unchosen -> chosen
    guard room/aHall `cleared` mark/yes
    assert path/as `cleared` mark/yes
    assert self `state` chosen
    retract self `state`

